graph TD
    %% Acid Shock
    A[Extreme Acid Exposure] --> B{OR: pH<br/>Level?}
    B -->|pH 5-7| C[Mild Acid]
    B -->|pH 2-3| D[Extreme Acid]
    
    C --> E[Periplasmic pH Drops]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Proton Influx]
    F --> G[Cytoplasmic Acidification]
    
    %% OR Gate: Which AR System?
    G --> H{OR: Which Acid<br/>Resistance?}
    H -->|AR1| I[Oxidative System]
    H -->|AR2| J[Glutamate-Dependent]
    H -->|AR3| K[Arginine-Dependent]
    
    %% AR1 System - Glucose Repressed
    I --> L{OR: Glucose<br/>Present?}
    L -->|Yes| M[\AR1 Repressed/]
    L -->|No| N[RpoS σS Activation]
    
    N --> O[Stationary Phase Stress]
    O --> P[RpoS Accumulation]
    P --> Q[AR1 Gene Expression]
    Q --> R[Oxidative Stress Proteins]
    R --> S[Catalases/Peroxidases]
    S --> T[ROS Detoxification]
    T --> U([Mild Protection])
    
    %% AR2 System - Glutamate
    J --> V{OR: Glutamate<br/>Available?}
    V -->|No| W[\AR2 Inactive/]
    V -->|Yes| X[GadE/W/X Regulators]
    
    X --> Y[gadABC Operon Induction]
    Y --> Z[GadA/GadB Decarboxylases]
    Z --> AA[GadC Glutamate/GABA Antiporter]
    
    %% Decarboxylation Reaction
    AA --> AB[External Glutamate Import]
    AB --> AC[Glutamate in Cytoplasm]
    AC --> AD[GadA/B Glutamate Decarboxylase]
    AD --> AE[Glu + H+ → GABA + CO2]
    AE --> AF[Proton Consumed]
    AF --> AG[Cytoplasmic pH Maintained]
    
    %% GABA Export
    AE --> AH[GABA Product]
    AH --> AI[GadC Antiporter]
    AI --> AJ[GABA Out / Glu In]
    AJ --> AK[Continuous Cycle]
    AK --> AL([Strong Protection pH 2-3])
    
    %% AR3 System - Arginine
    K --> AM["\OR: Arginine<br/>Available?"]
    AM -->|No| AN[\AR3 Inactive/]
    AM -->|Yes| AO[AdiA Arginine Decarboxylase]
    
    AO --> AP[Arginine in Cytoplasm]
    AP --> AQ["AdiA: Arg + H+ → Agmatine + CO2"]
    AQ --> AR[Proton Consumed]
    AR --> AS[pH Maintained]
    
    AQ --> AT[Agmatine Product]
    AT --> AU[AdiC Antiporter]
    AU --> AV[Agmatine Out / Arg In]
    AV --> AW[/Continuous Cycle/]
    AW --> AX([Moderate Protection])
    
    %% EvgA/S Regulation
    E --> AY[EvgS Sensor Kinase]
    AY --> AZ[Mild Acid Detection]
    AZ --> BA[EvgS Autophosphorylation]
    BA --> BB[EvgA Phosphorylation]
    BB --> BC[EvgA~P Active]
    BC --> BD[gadE/gadX/gadW Expression]
    BD --> X
    
    %% GadE Cascade
    X --> BE[GadE Master Regulator]
    BE --> BF[GadE Activates gadA/gadB/gadC]
    BF --> Y
    
    %% Other Protective Mechanisms
    G --> BG{OR: Other<br/>Protection?}
    BG -->|F1Fo ATPase| BH[Proton Pump Reversal]
    BG -->|Amino Acid Transport| BI[Lysine/Ornithine Decarboxylases]
    BG -->|DNA Repair| BJ[Base Excision Repair]
    
    BH --> BK[ATP-Dependent H+ Export]
    BK --> BL[Energy Cost]
    BI --> BM[/Alternative Decarboxylation/]
    BJ --> BN[Repair Acid Damage]
    
    BL --> BO["(\1)"]
    BM --> BO
    BN --> BO
    AL --> BO
    AX --> BO
    U --> BO
    
    M --> BP([Acid Sensitive])
    W --> BP
    AN --> BP
    
